#: 6672552601f44ad9b9f3efae3ff6651f
msgid ""
"First-time setup of the autopilot includes downloading and installing a "
"Ground Control Station (GCS), mounting the autopilot to the frame, "
"connecting it to the receiver, power and motors, and then performing initial"
" configuration and calibration."
msgstr "飞控的首次配置包括：下载并安装地面站（GCS）软件、将飞控安装到机架上、连接接收机/电源/电机，然后完成初始配置与校准。"

